Note: End-to-end test of the pure-Flow test library.
Note: Exercises passing AND failing cases for every assertion, then calls summary.

use "@std"
use "@collections"
use "@test"

(print "=== test_test_library.flow ===")

Note: Collect the Bool result of each assertion into a single array.
Note: 10 PASS cases + 9 FAIL cases = 19 entries total -> summary reports 10 / 9 / 19.
Bool[] results = (list
    (assertTrue  true                "assertTrue PASS case")
    (assertTrue  false               "assertTrue FAIL case (expected FAIL)")
    (assertFalse false               "assertFalse PASS case")
    (assertFalse true                "assertFalse FAIL case (expected FAIL)")
    (assertEqual 2 2                 "assertEqual Int PASS case")
    (assertEqual 2 3                 "assertEqual Int FAIL case (expected FAIL)")
    (assertEqual "hi" "hi"           "assertEqual String PASS case")
    (assertNotEqual 2 3              "assertNotEqual PASS case")
    (assertNotEqual 2 2              "assertNotEqual FAIL case (expected FAIL)")
    (assertLess 1 2                  "assertLess PASS case")
    (assertLess 2 1                  "assertLess FAIL case (expected FAIL)")
    (assertGreater 5 3               "assertGreater PASS case")
    (assertGreater 3 5               "assertGreater FAIL case (expected FAIL)")
    (assertLessOrEqual 2 2           "assertLessOrEqual PASS equal")
    (assertLessOrEqual 3 2           "assertLessOrEqual FAIL case (expected FAIL)")
    (assertGreaterOrEqual 2 2        "assertGreaterOrEqual PASS equal")
    (assertGreaterOrEqual 1 2        "assertGreaterOrEqual FAIL case (expected FAIL)")
    (assertApproxEqual 1.0 1.0001 0.001 "assertApproxEqual PASS within epsilon")
    (assertApproxEqual 1.0 1.5    0.001 "assertApproxEqual FAIL outside epsilon (expected FAIL)")
)

Note: Exercise the test runner with a zero-arg Function thunk returning a Bool.
Bool tResult = (test "inline test: 2 + 2 = 4" (fn => (equals (add 2 2) 4)))
(print (str tResult))

Note: Tally the collected Bool[]. summary returns true only if every result is true.
Bool allGreen = (summary results)
(print (concat "All green? " (str allGreen)))

(print "=== test_test_library.flow complete ===")
